title: Romans 3 – The Oracles of God Prove All Are Guilty
description: Romans 3: the oracles of God prove Jew and Gentile alike guilty, the whole chapter in the KJV, God's plan for the heathen, and salvation as a finished work.
output: lessons/romans/romans-3.html

# Folds romans-3-oracles.html (main), romans-3-romans-3kjv.html (KJV for projection), romans-3-romans-3-gentiles.html
# (God's Plan for the Heathen) and romans-3-reconciliation.html (Salvation: A Finished Work, last).
# Verse text comes from the builder; where an old page's quotation differed from the KJV, the KJV is used.

=== The oracles of God
--- Romans Chapter 3 [title]
overline: A study in Romans 3
heading: Romans Chapter 3
sub: The Oracles of God Prove That Jew and Gentile Alike Are Guilty Before God

--- Paul’s Question After Romans 2
lead: Romans 2 just finished proving there is **NO difference** between Jew and Greek (Gentile).
- God is **no respecter of persons**.
- Circumcision and being under the Law profit nothing if you sin.
- Not having the Law is no excuse if you do right by nature.
big: Romans 3:1

--- Paul’s Answer
lead: **Much every way!** Chiefly, because unto them were committed **the oracles of God**, the inspired Old Testament Scriptures ([[Romans 3:2]]).
p: Paul now uses those very **oracles of God** (the Law and the Prophets) to prove his point to both Jew and Gentile.
p: This silences proud Jews and shows believing Gentiles that **grace for all nations was always God’s plan**.

--- Romans 3:4: Quoting David
p: “God forbid: yea, let God be true, but every man a liar…” is a direct quote from David after his sin with Bathsheba:
scripture: Psalm 51:4 | mark: thee, thee only, have I sinned; justified when thou speakest, and be clear when thou judgest

--- Romans 3:10-18: “As It Is Written”
lead: Paul compiles a devastating chain of Old Testament passages to prove **ALL** (Jew and Gentile) are guilty before God.
table: Romans 3 Verse | Old Testament Oracle Quoted
tr: vv. 10-12: “There is none righteous, no, not one” | [[Psalm 14:1-3]] · [[Psalm 53:1-3]] · [[Ecclesiastes 7:20]]
tr: v. 13: “Their throat is an open sepulchre… poison of asps” | [[Psalm 5:9]] · [[Psalm 140:3]]
tr: v. 14: “Whose mouth is full of cursing and bitterness” | [[Psalm 10:7]]
tr: vv. 15-17: “Their feet are swift to shed blood… way of peace have not known” | [[Isaiah 59:7-8]]
tr: v. 18: “There is no fear of God before their eyes” | [[Psalm 36:1]]

--- All Are Guilty
center: Paul uses the Jews’ own Scriptures to prove that **ALL are guilty under the Law**, that **ALL stand condemned before God**, and therefore **ALL need the righteousness of Christ by faith alone**!

